🧱 📁 Full Folder Structure (Module Pattern অনুযায়ী)
src/modules/
├── Auth/
├── User/
├── Event/
├── Registration/
├── Review/
├── Payment/
└── Dashboard/


🔐 1. Auth Module
Auth/
├── auth.constant.ts
├── auth.controller.ts
├── auth.interface.ts
├── auth.route.ts
├── auth.service.ts
├── auth.utils.ts
└── auth.validation.ts

| Method | Endpoint              | Description       | কার জন্য |
| ------ | --------------------- | ----------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /auth/register        | User register     | Public   |
-----------------------------------------------------------------
| POST   | /auth/login           | Login + JWT       | Public   |
-----------------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /auth/me              | Current user info | User     |
-----------------------------------------------------------------
| POST   | /auth/change-password | Change password   | User     |
-----------------------------------------------------------------


👤 2. User Module
User/
├── user.controller.ts
├── user.service.ts
├── user.route.ts
└── user.validation.ts

| Method | Endpoint       | Description      | কার জন্য   |
| ------ | -------------- | ---------------- | ---------- |
| GET    | /users         | Get all users    | Admin      |
-----------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /users/:id     | Get user profile | Admin/User |
-----------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /users/:id     | Update profile   | User       |
-----------------------------------------------------------
| DELETE | /users/:id     | Delete user      | Admin      |
-----------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /users/ban/:id | Ban user         | Admin      |
-----------------------------------------------------------


🎉 3. Event Module (CORE MODULE)
Event/
├── event.controller.ts
├── event.service.ts
├── event.route.ts
├── event.validation.ts
└── event.interface.ts

🔹 Public APIs
| Method | Endpoint    | Description      | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------- | ---------------- | -------- |
| GET    | /events     | সব public events | Public   |
------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /events/:id | event details    | Public   |
------------------------------------------------------

🔹 User APIs
| Method | Endpoint          | Description       | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------------- | ----------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /events           | Create event      | User     |
-------------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /events/:id       | Update event      | Owner    |
-------------------------------------------------------------
| DELETE | /events/:id       | Delete event      | Owner    |
-------------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /events/my-events | My created events | User     |
-------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Admin APIs
| Method | Endpoint           | Description          | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------ | -------------------- | -------- |
| PATCH  | /events/status/:id | Approve/Reject event | Admin    |
-----------------------------------------------------------------
| DELETE | /events/admin/:id  | Force delete         | Admin    |
-----------------------------------------------------------------


🧾 4. Registration Module (VERY IMPORTANT)
Registration/
├── registration.controller.ts
├── registration.service.ts
├── registration.route.ts
├── registration.validation.ts
└── registration.interface.ts

🔹 Join Event
| Method | Endpoint                     | Description     | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ---------------------------- | --------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/join/:eventId | Join free event | User     |
----------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Paid Join
| Method | Endpoint                         | Description       | কার জন্য |
| ------ | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/pay-join/:eventId | Paid join request | User     |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Private Event Request
| Method | Endpoint                        | Description     | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------------------- | --------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/request/:eventId | Request to join | User     |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Invitations
| Method | Endpoint                  | Description   | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------------- | ------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/invite     | Invite user   | Owner    |
-----------------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /registrations/accept/:id | Accept invite | User     |
-----------------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /registrations/reject/:id | Reject invite | User     |
-----------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Owner Controls
| Method | Endpoint                   | Description         | কার জন্য |
| ------ | -------------------------- | ------------------- | -------- |
| PATCH  | /registrations/approve/:id | Approve participant | Owner    |
------------------------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /registrations/reject/:id  | Reject participant  | Owner    |
------------------------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /registrations/ban/:id     | Ban user            | Owner    |
------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 View Participants
| Method | Endpoint                      | Description        | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------ | -------- |
| GET    | /registrations/event/:eventId | Event participants | Owner    |
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /registrations/my             | My registrations   | User     |
--------------------------------------------------------------------------


⭐ 5. Review Module
Review/
├── review.controller.ts
├── review.service.ts
├── review.route.ts
└── review.validation.ts

| Method | Endpoint                | Description   | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------------------- | ------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /reviews                | Create review | User     |
---------------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /reviews/event/:eventId | Event reviews | Public   |
---------------------------------------------------------------
| PATCH  | /reviews/:id            | Update review | User     |
---------------------------------------------------------------
| DELETE | /reviews/:id            | Delete review | User     |
---------------------------------------------------------------


💳 6. Payment Module (Future-ready but keep minimal now)
Payment/
├── payment.interface.ts
├── payment.controller.ts
├── payment.service.ts
├── payment.route.ts
└── payment.utils.ts

| Method | Endpoint               | Description              | 
| ------ | ------------------     | ------------------------ 
| POST   | /payments/initiate     | Start payment            |     
---------------------------------------------------------------------
| POST   | /payments/webhook      | verify signature         |   |
---------------------------------------------------------------------
| GET   | GET /payments/my        | user payment history     |   | Optional
---------------------------------------------------------------------
| GET   | GET /payments/:id       | user payment history     |   | Optional


📊 7. Dashboard Module (Optional but useful)
Dashboard/
├── dashboard.controller.ts
├── dashboard.service.ts
└── dashboard.route.ts

| Method | Endpoint               | Description     | কার জন্য   |
| ------ | ---------------------- | --------------- | ---------- |
| GET    | /dashboard/overview    | Stats           | User/Admin |
------------------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /dashboard/my-events   | My events       | User       |
------------------------------------------------------------------
| GET    | /dashboard/invitations | Pending invites | User       |
------------------------------------------------------------------



🧾 1. REGISTRATION APIs (FINAL)
✅ 1. Join public free
POST /registrations/join/:eventId

✅ 2. Get my registrations
GET /registrations/my

✅ 3. Get event participants (owner)
GET /registrations/event/:eventId

✅ 4. Invite user
POST /registrations/invite

✅ 5. Get my invitations
GET /registrations/invitations

✅ 6. Accept invitation (FREE)
PATCH /registrations/accept/:id

✅ 7. Reject invitation
PATCH /registrations/reject/:id

✅ 8. Approve participant
PATCH /registrations/approve/:id

✅ 9. Reject participant
PATCH /registrations/reject-participant/:id

✅ 10. Ban participant
PATCH /registrations/ban/:id




💳 2. PAYMENT APIs (CRITICAL)
✅ 11. Initiate payment             -->   🔥 Backend logic:  check event, check invited (if private), create Stripe PaymentIntent, create Payment row
POST /payments/initiate

✅ 12. Stripe Webhook (MOST IMPORTANT)
POST /payments/webhook


🟡 OPTIONAL (but strong production)
✅ 13. Get my payments
GET /payments/my

✅ 14. Refund (admin/owner)
POST /payments/refund/:paymentId